.TH DDN-DOWN "1" "2026\-11\-25" "ddnetmirror 0.0.1" "ddnetmirror manual"
.SH NAME
ddn down \- destroy the lab described by ddnetmirror.yml
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ddn
down [-h]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Destroy the lab described by ./ddnetmirror.yml: run 'containerlab destroy \-t ./NAME.clab.yml \-\-cleanup' (through sudo unless containerlab runs as you) and exit with its status. Refuses unless NAME.clab.yml is a regular file for lab NAME. ddnetmirror.yml, the topology and the configs are kept; no CloudVision access.

.SH DISTRIBUTION
The latest version of ddnetmirror may be downloaded from
.UR https://github.com/DaphnisDuck/ddnetmirror
.UE
